# A KQL-only property says it is not supported yet.
mode: check
schema: t(customerId: string, month: datetime, revenue: real, n: long)
---- query
from t
| render timechart with (ysplit = panels)
---- expected
error[DS5004]: the render property `ysplit` is not supported yet
  --> query:2:26
  |
2 | | render timechart with (ysplit = panels)
  |                          ^^^^^^ a KQL property DataScript does not support yet
  |
  = note: the properties are title, xcolumn, ycolumns, series, xtitle, ytitle, legend, ymin, ymax, kind
